## 🚀 What's Ready Now

### For Testing:
```bash
# Test the web app locally
http-server dist/

# Or with Node.js
npx serve dist/
```

### For APK Building:
```bash
# Sync with Android
npx cap sync

# Build APK
npx cap build android

# Run on device/emulator
npx cap run android
```

### For Production:
```bash
# Build release APK
cd android
./gradlew assembleRelease
cd ..

# Sign and optimize
jarsigner -verbose ... (see BUILD_GUIDE.md)
zipalign -v 4 ...
```

